<title>UK: Lehman Brothers sets warrants on German stocks.</title>
<headline>Lehman Brothers sets warrants on German stocks.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers Finance SA has issued 50 million American-style call warrants, in 10 equal tranches, on Deutsche Bank AG and Commerzbank AG, lead manager Lehman Brothers Bankhaus AG said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> WARRANTS  STRIKE  ISS PRICE  PREMIUM    GEARING	MATURITY</p>
<p>DEUTSCHE BANK</p>
<p> CALL A*   80.00   4.40 DEM    7.10 PCT  17.90 TIMES  30.SEP.97</p>
<p> CALL B*   82.50   4.35 DEM   10.22 PCT  18.12 TIMES  30.DEC.97</p>
<p> CALL C*   85.00   4.40 DEM   13.45 PCT  17.90 TIMES  30.MAR.98</p>
<p> CALL D*   90.00   3.50 DEM   18.65 PCT  22.55 TIMES  30.JUN.98</p>
<p> CALL E**  90.00   5.87 DEM   21.66 PCT  13.42 TIMES  30.JUL.99</p>
<p>COMMERZBANK</p>
<p> CALL F*   45.00   2.75 DEM    8.89 PCT  15.95 TIMES  30.SEP.97</p>
<p> CALL G*   47.50   2.25 DEM   13.45 PCT  19.48 TIMES  30.DEC.97</p>
<p> CALL H*   50.00   1.95 DEM   18.47 PCT  22.48 TIMES  30.MAR.98</p>
<p> CALL I*   52.50   1.65 DEM   23.49 PCT  26.58 TIMES  30.JUN.98</p>
<p> CALL J**  52.50   2.60 DEM   16.86 PCT  16.86 TIMES  30.JUL.99</p>
<p> PAYDATE 31.JAN.97     LISTING FFT STG DDF     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  DEUTSCHE BANK 78.80 DEM, COMMERZBANK 43.85 DEM</p>
<p> NOTES	     *SPRINTER WARRANTS **MARATHON WARRANTS</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
